# Product docs hierarchy

When specs conflict, resolve in this order (do not ask the user to restate it):

1. `docs/mvp.md` — master product scope (wins all conflicts)
2. `docs/sprint-current.md` (or `docs/sprint1.md`) — what to build this sprint only
3. Feature docs under `docs/` — detail for the feature being implemented
4. Psychology / Business / Multiplayer Arena — post-MVP or philosophy only; not build authority

## Hard rules

- Do not implement features listed in MVP Section 10 (out of scope).
- Canonical names: "The Peek and Pitch" (not "The Swipe"); tagging tray items are "Badges" (not "Profile Tags").
- Level templates: L1 Peek and Pitch, L2 Sniper Slider, L3 Detective Board.
- Daily Challenge: Gold Coins only — never Elo, XP, or Chip cost on failure.
- Bankroll never reads/writes Gold Coins, Chips, or Elo.
- Prefer `@docs/mvp.md` + current sprint file over pasting full specs into chat.
